    {
      "id": "os-ch01-001",
      "stemEn": "An operating system is software that manages ().",
      "stemCn": "操作系统是对（）进行管理的软件。",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "textEn": "Software",
          "textCn": "软件"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "textEn": "Hardware",
          "textCn": "硬件"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "textEn": "Computer resources",
          "textCn": "计算机资源"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "textEn": "Application programs",
          "textCn": "应用程序"
        }
      ],
      "answerKey": "C",
      "explanationCn": "操作系统的核心作用是管理和控制计算机系统中的各种资源，包括处理器、存储器、设备和文件等，因此应选计算机资源。",
      "explanationEn": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "os-ch01-002",
      "stemEn": "An operating system is a kind of ().",
      "stemCn": "操作系统是一种（）。",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "textEn": "Software package",
          "textCn": "软件包"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "textEn": "Application software",
          "textCn": "应用软件"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "textEn": "General-purpose software",
          "textCn": "通用软件"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "textEn": "System software",
          "textCn": "系统软件"
        }
      ],
      "answerKey": "D",
      "explanationCn": "操作系统直接管理硬件资源，并为应用程序提供运行环境和系统服务，属于系统软件而不是应用软件。",
      "explanationEn": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "os-ch01-003",
      "stemEn": "Which of the following is not a basic characteristic of multiprogramming?",
      "stemCn": "下列选项中，不属于多道程序设计的基本特征是（）。",
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "textEn": "Intermittence",
          "textCn": "间断性"
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "textEn": "Multiplicity",
          "textCn": "多道性"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "textEn": "Sequentiality",
          "textCn": "顺序性"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "textEn": "Unpredictability",
          "textCn": "无序性"
        }
      ],
      "answerKey": "C",
      "explanationCn": "多道程序设计强调多个程序并发执行，具有多道性、间断性和无序性等特点。顺序性更符合单道程序顺序执行的特征，不属于多道程序设计的基本特征。",
      "explanationEn": ""
    },
    {
